  "disclosures": [
    "Flow direction is inferred from prices only — not measured capital flows. TIC data lag 6-7 weeks; EPFR is paid and covers only fund flows. FX-hedged flows leave no FX trace. SWF/OTC flows are invisible to all proxies. Managed pegs truncate FX signals (CNH stays illustrative-tier).",
    "Partial EMP only — reserve/intervention leg unobservable free+daily (CBF-R4). CBF-R5: correlation-based filter (common_factor) never stands alone — Forbes-Rigobon upward bias in high-vol windows.",
    "CBF-R6: swap lines are confirmation tier, never a trigger. Bahaj-Reis (2022): drawings cap CIP deviations (funding ceiling) but do not fix solvency. Zero drawings do not indicate absence of stress (stigma asymmetry).",
    "Display-only context artifact (CBF-R1). Nothing here is scored, fed to conviction, or collapsed into BUY/SELL. Promotion requires intl_phase0 pre-registration."
